{
  "_note": "各国 10 年(mode=world)与利率总表(mode=board):美国财政部名义 / 实际曲线 + 德国央行 + 日本财务省。全部收盘口径。财政部当年文件取不到 = 失败(G26);德国 / 日本缺了只让那一行写 --。日本只有当月文件,故只有日变化。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "zh",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "语言:文案在取数层按语言出。切语言 = 整盘重取,数据缓存含 locale。没注入 @app 时按英文(overseas-first §2)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y0",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy)]"
      },
      "_note": "今年(按设备时区;跨年那几个小时差一天无妨:两年的文件都会取)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${y0}-1),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "去年。⚠️ 进 URL 的数字过 parseNumber(Android calc 返回 2025.0)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "modeIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${mode},world)]"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。mode = world(各国 10 年)/ board(利率总表)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bN",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${modeIn},board),372,10)]"
      },
      "_note": "德国央行取几个**日历日**(周末也占一行):总表要往前 250 个交易日 ≈ 365 天;各国 10 年只要最近两个交易日,10 天兜住长假。"
    },
    {
      "action": "concurrent",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "nc",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/daily-treasury-rates.csv/${y0}/all?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve&field_tdr_date_value=${y0}&page&_format=csv",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "np",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/daily-treasury-rates.csv/${y1}/all?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve&field_tdr_date_value=${y1}&page&_format=csv",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rc",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/daily-treasury-rates.csv/${y0}/all?type=daily_treasury_real_yield_curve&field_tdr_date_value=${y0}&page&_format=csv",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rp",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/daily-treasury-rates.csv/${y1}/all?type=daily_treasury_real_yield_curve&field_tdr_date_value=${y1}&page&_format=csv",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "de",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.statistiken.bundesbank.de/rest/data/BBSIS/D.I.ZAR.ZI.EUR.S1311.B.A604.R10XX.R.A.A._Z._Z.A?lastNObservations=${bN}&format=csv&lang=en",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000"
          },
          "_note": "德国央行 10 年(期限结构推算)。"
        },
        {
          "id": "jp",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.mof.go.jp/english/policy/jgbs/reference/interest_rate/jgbcme.csv",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000"
          },
          "_note": "日本财务省当月 CSV。"
        }
      ],
      "_note": "六个请求互不依赖,并发一次往返。德国 / 日本取不到只让那一行写 --,不让整张卡失败。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / concurrent 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(memory actionflow-concurrent-late-merge)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nok",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${nc},),Date),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "当年文件必须是 CSV(以列头 Date 开头);拿到的是错误页 / 空串 = 取数失败(G26),不许拿去年的数冒充最新。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${nok},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "treasury unavailable"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nokP",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${np},),Date),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${nokP},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "treasury (previous year) unavailable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "要算「1 年前」/ 一年走势的流,上一年文件同样必需;缺了宁可失败(宿主贴上次成功的那帧),也不画半截。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nA",
        "value": "$[split::(${nc},\\n)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nP",
        "value": "$[split::(findNotEmpty::(${np},),\\n)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ndC",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(length::(${nA})-1),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "当年数据行数(第 0 行是列头;末尾空串已被 split 去掉)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "nc"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "np"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(1,${ndC}),index::(${nA},1),index::(${nP},calc::(1-${ndC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rD",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(2,${ndC}),index::(${nA},2),index::(${nP},calc::(2-${ndC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rM",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(22,${ndC}),index::(${nA},22),index::(${nP},calc::(22-${ndC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rY",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(251,${ndC}),index::(${nA},251),index::(${nP},calc::(251-${ndC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "nA"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "nP"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rok",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${rc},),Date),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "当年文件必须是 CSV(以列头 Date 开头);拿到的是错误页 / 空串 = 取数失败(G26),不许拿去年的数冒充最新。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${rok},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "treasury unavailable"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rokP",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${rp},),Date),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rA",
        "value": "$[split::(${rc},\\n)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rP",
        "value": "$[split::(findNotEmpty::(${rp},),\\n)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rdC",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(length::(${rA})-1),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "当年数据行数(第 0 行是列头;末尾空串已被 split 去掉)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "rc"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "rp"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(1,${rdC}),index::(${rA},1),index::(${rP},calc::(1-${rdC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tD",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(2,${rdC}),index::(${rA},2),index::(${rP},calc::(2-${rdC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tM",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(22,${rdC}),index::(${rA},22),index::(${rP},calc::(22-${rdC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tY",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(251,${rdC}),index::(${rA},251),index::(${rP},calc::(251-${rdC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "rA"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "rP"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(findNotEmpty::(${dL},)),9),connect::(subString::(${dL},0,2),-,subString::(${dL},3,5)),--)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us3mL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),4),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us3mD",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rD},\\,),4),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us3mM",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),4),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us3mY",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rY},\\,),4),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us2yL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),8),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us2yD",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rD},\\,),8),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us2yM",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),8),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us2yY",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rY},\\,),8),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us10yL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),12),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us10yD",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rD},\\,),12),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us10yM",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),12),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us10yY",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rY},\\,),12),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us30yL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),14),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us30yD",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rD},\\,),14),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us30yM",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),14),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "us30yY",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rY},\\,),14),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usr10L",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${tL},\\,),3),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "s2s10L",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${us10yL},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${us2yL},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1)),calc::(${us10yL}-${us2yL}),)]"
      },
      "_note": "利差与收益率同一单位(百分点)存,变化走同一套 bp() 换算(×100 = 基点)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usr10D",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${tD},\\,),3),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "s2s10D",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${us10yD},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${us2yD},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1)),calc::(${us10yD}-${us2yD}),)]"
      },
      "_note": "利差与收益率同一单位(百分点)存,变化走同一套 bp() 换算(×100 = 基点)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usr10M",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${tM},\\,),3),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "s2s10M",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${us10yM},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${us2yM},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1)),calc::(${us10yM}-${us2yM}),)]"
      },
      "_note": "利差与收益率同一单位(百分点)存,变化走同一套 bp() 换算(×100 = 基点)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usr10Y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${tY},\\,),3),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "s2s10Y",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${us10yY},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${us2yY},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1)),calc::(${us10yY}-${us2yY}),)]"
      },
      "_note": "利差与收益率同一单位(百分点)存,变化走同一套 bp() 换算(×100 = 基点)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "rL"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "rD"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "rM"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "rY"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "tL"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "tD"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "tM"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "tY"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usN",
        "value": "$[calc::(parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${dL},/),2),0),0)*10000+parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${dL},/),0),0),0)*100+parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${dL},/),1),0),0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "deA",
        "value": "$[split::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${de},),[0-9]+-[0-9]+-[0-9]+\\,[.]\\,[^\\n]*\\n?,),\\n)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "deN",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(length::(${deA}),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "de"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "deL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(index::(${deA},calc::(${deN}-1)),\\,),1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "deD",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(index::(${deA},calc::(${deN}-2)),\\,),1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "deM",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${deN},31),findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(index::(${deA},calc::(${deN}-22)),\\,),1),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "deY",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${deN},260),findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(index::(${deA},calc::(${deN}-251)),\\,),1),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "den1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(index::(${deA},calc::(${deN}-1)),\\,),0),0),-,),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "最新 / 前一个交易日的日期 → 数字 yyyymmdd(跨国利差按同一天对齐用)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "den2",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(index::(${deA},calc::(${deN}-2)),\\,),0),0),-,),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "deA"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "de10L",
        "value": "${deL}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "de10D",
        "value": "${deD}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "de10M",
        "value": "${deM}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "de10Y",
        "value": "${deY}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpA",
        "value": "$[split::(findNotEmpty::(${jp},),\\r?\\n)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpN",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(length::(${jpA}),0)]"
      }
